# ── n8n workflow exports — never commit these ───────────────────────────────
# Their Config nodes carry live credentials (Simkl client id + access token,
# TMDB API key, Plex account id), and a scrubbed copy drifts out of date the
# moment the real workflow is edited in n8n. The workflows live in n8n; this
# repo holds the embeds and the feed contract they depend on.
**/n8n/
Plex_Live_Session.json
Carrd_Media_Feed.json
Plex_to_Trakt_Scrobbler.json
Carrd_Trakt_Feed*.json
